{"area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "area_name": "FINTRAC reporting & AML", "commits": [{"sha": "a1ab056", "fact_id": "Fb3ec53458b9", "message": "If it smells like AML or FINTRAC, send it to Tom.", "quote": "If it smells like AML or FINTRAC, send it to Tom.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "dave", "author_name": "Dave MacLeod", "date": "2026-07-22", "valid_from": "2026-07-22", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002704", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C01GENERAL/p1784725608472029"}, {"sha": "efb41e9", "fact_id": "Fdc156aeab38", "message": "Working notes on FINTRAC reporting.", "quote": "Working notes on FINTRAC reporting.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-15", "valid_from": "2026-07-15", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "doc-0017", "source_type": "doc", "url": "https://harbourline.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/HCU/pages/100017/fintrac-reporting-aml-runbook"}, {"sha": "667a8c5", "fact_id": "Fa8c71d3d405", "message": "AML: And never mention it to the member, that's tipping off and it's an offence.", "quote": "And never mention it to the member, that's tipping off and it's an offence.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-15", "valid_from": "2026-07-15", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "doc-0017", "source_type": "doc", "url": "https://harbourline.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/HCU/pages/100017/fintrac-reporting-aml-runbook"}, {"sha": "d125be6", "fact_id": "F3c56d0a3a4a", "message": "FINTRAC says 'as soon as practicable'.", "quote": "FINTRAC says 'as soon as practicable'.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-14", "valid_from": "2026-07-14", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "email-000183", "source_type": "email", "url": "https://mail.harbourlinecu.ca/thread/email-000182/email-000183"}, {"sha": "2e810c2", "fact_id": "F42e7dade343", "message": "For anyone touching this — International wires of 10k or more need an EFTR within five working days.", "quote": "FYI for anyone touching this — International wires of 10k or more need an EFTR within five working days.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-14", "valid_from": "2026-07-14", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002558", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1784041215883817"}, {"sha": "50fd4f4", "fact_id": "F3814781973b", "message": "From now on nothing goes to FINTRAC without Jen's check first.", "quote": "From now on nothing goes to FINTRAC without Jen's check first.", "kind": "decision", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-13", "valid_from": "2026-07-13", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002529", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1783954457002602?thread_ts=1783953247.994683"}, {"sha": "33e1457", "fact_id": "Fb6cbe12d3d3", "message": "I review the batch in the AML monitor and it submits.", "quote": "I review the batch in the AML monitor and it submits.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-13", "valid_from": "2026-07-13", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "email-000181", "source_type": "email", "url": "https://mail.harbourlinecu.ca/thread/email-000179/email-000181"}, {"sha": "38511df", "fact_id": "F8379fe34edf", "message": "EFTRs are 5 working days, tighter than LCTRs, so don't sit on wire paperwork.", "quote": "Short version: EFTRs are 5 working days, tighter than LCTRs, so don't sit on wire paperwork.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-08", "valid_from": "2026-07-08", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002442", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C04OPS/p1783506130867979?thread_ts=1783503792.860060"}, {"sha": "d7cfa4d", "fact_id": "F898944f9a9e", "message": "As of this week LCTRs go through the FINTRAC API straight out of the AML monitor.", "quote": "As of this week LCTRs go through the FINTRAC API straight out of the AML monitor.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-06", "valid_from": "2026-07-06", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002379", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1783329461677923"}, {"sha": "c93d0d8", "fact_id": "Ffe86d1de1f6", "message": "Don't investigate yourselves.", "quote": "Don't investigate yourselves.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-07-01", "valid_from": "2026-07-01", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002320", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C07MEMBERSVC/p1782908553757113?thread_ts=1782906714.749194"}, {"sha": "cb7263b", "fact_id": "F3e70254c4e1", "message": "Tom's our compliance officer, LCTRs, STRs, the whole AML program, it's all him.", "quote": "Short version: Tom's our compliance officer, LCTRs, STRs, the whole AML program, it's all him.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "dave", "author_name": "Dave MacLeod", "date": "2026-06-29", "valid_from": "2026-06-29", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002283", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C07MEMBERSVC/p1782750636464110?thread_ts=1782749825.456191"}, {"sha": "f15e2da", "fact_id": "Ff4290a48493", "message": "Cash of ten thousand or more (single or combined over 24 hours) = large cash report.", "quote": "Heads up all: Cash of ten thousand or more (single or combined over 24 hours) = large cash report.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "jen", "author_name": "Jen Theriault", "date": "2026-06-25", "valid_from": "2026-06-25", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002219", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1782391250598733"}, {"sha": "a01555e", "fact_id": "F3caa6d2ce31", "message": "Record keeping is 5 years for large cash stuff, don't shred anything in the Compliance boxes.", "quote": "Record keeping is 5 years for large cash stuff, don't shred anything in the Compliance boxes.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-06-22", "valid_from": "2026-06-22", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002136", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C07MEMBERSVC/p1782121030978845?thread_ts=1782118294.970926"}, {"sha": "fff63ab", "fact_id": "F2b35f1a5509", "message": "Sorry to bug you @tom — FINTRAC reporting question", "quote": "Sorry to bug you @tom — FINTRAC reporting question", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "priya", "author_name": "Priya Nair", "date": "2026-06-18", "valid_from": "2026-06-18", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002075", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1781780988836303"}, {"sha": "f9a02b5", "fact_id": "F785bdc87365", "message": "EFTR deadline is five business days after the wire.", "quote": "Reminder: EFTR deadline is five business days after the wire.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-06-18", "valid_from": "2026-06-18", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-002078", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1781783025844222?thread_ts=1781780988.836303"}, {"sha": "7826c03", "fact_id": "F0c1c8c4ebf3", "message": "15 days from the date of the cash transaction for LCTRs.", "quote": "Reminder: 15 days from the date of the cash transaction for LCTRs.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-05-21", "valid_from": "2026-05-21", "valid_to": "2026-07-01", "is_current": false, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": "F7b60bdd0ff0", "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "email-000106", "source_type": "email", "url": "https://mail.harbourlinecu.ca/thread/email-000105/email-000106"}, {"sha": "ecdb071", "fact_id": "F79b1e8ba1dc", "message": "Don't file anything yourself.", "quote": "Don't file anything yourself.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "dave", "author_name": "Dave MacLeod", "date": "2026-05-06", "valid_from": "2026-05-06", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-001243", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1778085033448272"}, {"sha": "543bda0", "fact_id": "Fc0e93514015", "message": "All FINTRAC reporting goes through Tom.", "quote": "PSA: All FINTRAC reporting goes through Tom.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "dave", "author_name": "Dave MacLeod", "date": "2026-05-06", "valid_from": "2026-05-06", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-001243", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1778085033448272"}, {"sha": "378bbbd", "fact_id": "F26c23a5a2bd", "message": "Internal standard for STRs: three working days max.", "quote": "Internal standard for STRs: three working days max.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-05-06", "valid_from": "2026-05-06", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-001232", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1778072752812546?thread_ts=1778070156.804627"}, {"sha": "0a0509b", "fact_id": "F776dde14158", "message": "Keep the LCTR slips, we hold those records five years.", "quote": "Keep the LCTR slips, we hold those records five years.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-04-27", "valid_from": "2026-04-27", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-001032", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1777288510963007?thread_ts=1777287025.955088"}, {"sha": "46327dd", "fact_id": "F6f2873cd7e9", "message": "Annual AML training is due for everyone by end of month", "quote": "Annual AML training is due for everyone by end of month", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-04-23", "valid_from": "2026-04-23", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-000983", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1776941076296001"}, {"sha": "f8a58a6", "fact_id": "Fb5838efe169", "message": "FINTRAC can't delete duplicates, I have to correct each one individually.", "quote": "FINTRAC can't delete duplicates, I have to correct each one individually.", "kind": "procedure", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-04-13", "valid_from": "2026-04-13", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-000760", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1776084765630409"}, {"sha": "a1450b4", "fact_id": "Ff46186b4282", "message": "Team: anything $10,000 or more in cash, or a few deposits adding up to that within 24 hours, gets an LCTR slip to Tom.", "quote": "Team: anything $10,000 or more in cash, or a few deposits adding up to that within 24 hours, gets an LCTR slip to Tom.", "kind": "fact", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "jen", "author_name": "Jen Theriault", "date": "2026-04-13", "valid_from": "2026-04-13", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-000779", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C07MEMBERSVC/p1776099047582895?thread_ts=1776096915.574976"}, {"sha": "36ea69a", "fact_id": "F5a0de4aa4c8", "message": "No, LCTRs are due within 15 calendar days of the transaction.", "quote": "Quick note so it's written down somewhere: No, LCTRs are due within 15 calendar days of the transaction.", "kind": "procedure", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-04-06", "valid_from": "2026-04-06", "valid_to": "2026-07-01", "is_current": false, "supersedes": "F768fe5be770", "superseded_by": "F7b60bdd0ff0", "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-000632", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/C07MEMBERSVC/p1775482465519543"}, {"sha": "850841e", "fact_id": "Fc1a73291688", "message": "I key the LCTRs into FINTRAC's Web Reporting System by hand every Thursday.", "quote": "I key the LCTRs into FINTRAC's Web Reporting System by hand every Thursday.", "kind": "recurring_task", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-04-01", "valid_from": "2026-04-01", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "email-000036", "source_type": "email", "url": "https://mail.harbourlinecu.ca/thread/email-000035/email-000036"}, {"sha": "e713fce", "fact_id": "Fca4e77ee1e4", "message": "We need to fix that before December.", "quote": "We need to fix that before December.", "kind": "procedure", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-03-31", "valid_from": "2026-03-31", "valid_to": null, "is_current": true, "supersedes": null, "superseded_by": null, "review_status": "pending", "doc_id": "slack-000538", "source_type": "slack", "url": "https://harbourline.slack.com/archives/G09COMPLIANCE/p1774963819915493"}, {"sha": "c6a96f7", "fact_id": "F23e163ee29e", "message": "Tom Bouchard owns FINTRAC reporting & AML — cheat sheet.", "quote": "Owner: Tom Bouchard", "kind": "owner", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "author": "tom", "author_name": "Tom Bouchard", "date": "2026-03